The bead was a duplicate investigation. The GGML gfx1151 workarounds were already in place:
- Auto-disable of HIP Graphs at compile time (`common.cuh:1198-1199`)
- Synchronous memcpy instead of async (`ggml-cuda.cu:669,681`)
- `GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_GRAPHS` env var support

The root cause was already identified in bead `lucebox-hub-gfx1151-5dq`: not a real hang, but extremely slow H2D memory transfer on the gfx1151 APU (994 MiB takes 12+ minutes).
